== (2) the denominator law for weighted mediants ==
 congruence D_u S_(uv) = -2^(A_u) beta mod D_(uv) on all 16129 pairs: True
 denominator law den(x_(uv)) = |D_(uv)|/gcd(beta, D_(uv)) on the 13780 coprime-clock pairs: True 
 so in the coprime-clock case the mediant is integral iff the clock of the whole divides the Farey determinant of the parts
